  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Democratic Stability in the Bangsamoro Autonomous Region in Muslim Mindanao</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to support BARMM&#x2019;s transition towards a fully functioning, elected democratic parliament by 2025, in a context still marked by post-conflict fragility. By reinforcing the foundations of accountable and inclusive governance, the initiative contributes to a long-term stability and the consolidation of peace in line with the Bangsamoro Organic Law</narrative>
  </description>
